<header class="page-header">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE / DELIVERY</p>
<h1>발송 검토</h1>
<p class="page-description">보류·결과 불명·수정 불가 작업을 확인하고 발송 상태를 처리하세요.</p>
</div>
<a class="button secondary" href="/logs">전송 로그 {{> icon name="arrow"}}</a>
</header>
<section data-page="delivery-jobs">
<div class="callout">{{> icon name="shield"}}<p>결과가 불명확한 발송은 중복을 막기 위해 다시 보내지 않습니다. Discord에서 확인한 메시지 ID를 등록하거나 보관하세요.</p>
</div>
<div class="panel table-panel">
<div class="panel-header">
<div>
<h2>발송 작업 상태</h2>
<p>이곳에서는 작업 상태를 처리합니다. 전송 결과 기록은 시스템 로그에서 확인하세요.</p>
</div>
<form method="get" action="/delivery-jobs" class="inline-form">
<label class="sr-only" for="delivery-state">상태 필터</label>
<select id="delivery-state" name="state" data-current="{{state}}">
<option value="">전체 상태</option>
<option value="held">검토 대기</option>
<option value="unknown">결과 불명</option>
<option value="failed">실패</option>
<option value="uneditable">수정 불가</option>
<option value="pending">발송 대기</option>
<option value="running">처리 중</option>
<option value="succeeded">완료</option>
<option value="cancelled">보관 / 취소</option>
</select>
<input type="hidden" name="sourceId" value="{{sourceId}}">
<button type="submit" class="secondary">조회</button>
</form>
</div>
<div class="table-scroll">
<table class="delivery-table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>소스 / 제목</th>
<th>전송 채널</th>
<th>상태</th>
<th>사유</th>
<th>검토</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>{{#each jobs}}<tr>
<td>
<a href="/sources/{{sourceId}}">{{sourceName}}</a>
<strong class="delivery-title">{{title}}</strong>
</td>
<td>{{destination}}</td>
<td>
<span class="badge {{state}}" data-job-state="{{state}}">{{state}}</span>
</td>
<td class="delivery-error">{{#if error}}{{error}}{{else}}<span class="muted">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
<td class="review-actions">
{{#if canSendHeld}}<form hx-post="/api/delivery-jobs/{{id}}/review">
<input type="hidden" name="decision" value="send">
<button type="submit" class="primary small">검토한 항목 발송</button>
</form>{{/if}}
{{#if canConfirm}}<details class="confirm-delivery">
<summary>발송 완료 확인</summary>
<form class="form-grid" hx-post="/api/delivery-jobs/{{id}}/review">
<input type="hidden" name="decision" value="confirm_delivered">
<label>확인한 메시지 ID<input name="messageId" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]+" required>
</label>
<label>스레드 ID (선택)<input name="threadId" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*">
</label>
<button type="submit" class="primary small">확인 등록</button>
</form>
</details>{{/if}}
{{#if canArchive}}<form hx-post="/api/delivery-jobs/{{id}}/review">
<input type="hidden" name="decision" value="historical">
<button type="submit" class="secondary small">과거 항목으로 보관</button>
</form>{{/if}}
</td>
</tr>{{else}}<tr>
<td colspan="5">
<div class="empty-state">
<span class="empty-icon">{{> icon name="check"}}</span>
<h3>표시할 발송 작업이 없습니다</h3>
<p>선택한 상태의 작업이 생기면 이곳에서 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
</div>
</td>
</tr>{{/each}}</tbody>
</table>
</div>{{#if nextBefore}}<div class="panel-pagination">
<a class="button secondary" href="/delivery-jobs?before={{nextBefore}}&amp;state={{state}}&amp;sourceId={{sourceId}}">이전 작업 더 보기</a>
</div>{{/if}}</div>
</section>
